\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Cross-sectional profiles of velocity, shear rate, and shear stress for a Bingham fluid flowing through a tube. The region near the center of the tube (where $r < r_0$) has zero shear rate. The velocity profile is flat in this region and then decreases towards the walls of the tube. The shear stress increases linearly with radius and exceeds the yield stress $\sigma _Y$ at $r = r_0$.}}{12}{figure.caption.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:malkin_3_9_cross_section}{{3}{12}{Cross-sectional profiles of velocity, shear rate, and shear stress for a Bingham fluid flowing through a tube. The region near the center of the tube (where $r < r_0$) has zero shear rate. The velocity profile is flat in this region and then decreases towards the walls of the tube. The shear stress increases linearly with radius and exceeds the yield stress $\sigma _Y$ at $r = r_0$}{figure.caption.3}{}}
